{"id": "t092-003", "text": "Theo and his partner Ann are moving to Glasgow on June 3rd. Their landlord finally agreed to let them out of the lease early. Ann has already found a job at a school in the West End, but Theo is still applying for things and has an interview over video next Monday. He admitted he's a bit nervous about moving without work lined up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Glasgow", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "landlord", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job at a school in the West End", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Monday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t092-006", "text": "Kavya called. Her mum is coming over from Pune next Tuesday and staying for a month, so Kavya is frantically clearing out the spare room. She mentioned her mum loves orchids, which might be worth remembering.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kavya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming over from Pune", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kavya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "orchids", "owner": "r1"}]}
{"id": "t092-014", "text": "Ioana Popescu, Alfie's old flatmate, is moving to Lisbon in a fortnight. Alfie seemed a bit down about it. They lived together for six years, and he's now got to find someone new for her room before July 1st or cover the rent himself. He asked if I'd keep an ear out.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana Popescu", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alfie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "old flatmate", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Lisbon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alfie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit down", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "find someone new for her room", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before July 1st", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t092-016", "text": "Aisha got the job! She starts at the architecture practice on August 4th. Send her flowers.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts at the architecture practice", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "August 4th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send her flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t092-019", "text": "Abigail is struggling with the job hunt. Six applications, no replies, and her redundancy pay runs out at the end of the month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abigail", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job hunt", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "redundancy pay runs out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t092-022", "text": "Hugo is starting a new job at a bank in Frankfurt in September, so he and Phoebe are house hunting over there. She's not sure about leaving her own job yet. They're flying out on the 18th for a week of viewings, and her mum is looking after their cat Mochi while they're away. Hugo says the German paperwork alone is a full-time job.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at a bank in Frankfurt", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Phoebe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "house hunting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sure about leaving her own job", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 18th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Mochi", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "while they're away", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t092-027", "text": "Patrick Hughes from the recruitment agency rang about the operations manager role. First stage is a video call on Tuesday, 10am. I need to prepare a short presentation on supply chain risk. If that goes well, the second stage is in person at their Birmingham office, probably the week of the 15th. Remind me to update my CV tonight before I forget.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Patrick Hughes", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "recruitment agency", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "video call", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday, 10am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "prepare a short presentation on supply chain risk", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second stage", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "probably the week of the 15th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "update my CV", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t092-028", "text": "Theo says his mum is selling the family house in Cork. She's moving into a smaller place near his aunt by the end of October. He's helping her sort through the attic this weekend and is dreading it. His dad died two years ago and most of his things are still up there. I should give Theo a ring on Monday to see how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "selling the family house in Cork", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving into a smaller place", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "aunt", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of October", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "helping her sort through the attic", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "two years ago", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "give Theo a ring", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t092-032", "text": "Kieran mentioned he hates open-plan offices, which is why he turned down the agency job last month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kieran", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates open-plan offices", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turned down the agency job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t092-039", "text": "Sofia and Samir are expecting their second baby in January. Their eldest, Leo, is very excited about being a big brother.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Samir", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leo", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t092-040", "text": "Long call with Layla tonight. Her housemate is moving out in two weeks, so she's either finding a replacement or giving notice herself. She's also got an interview at the hospital trust on Friday, which would mean commuting to Reading. Her boyfriend Kieran thinks she should take it if offered, but she's worried about the hours. I promised I'd help her look at rooms on Sunday. Need to ring her Thursday night to wish her luck.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Layla", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "housemate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving out", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in two weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at the hospital trust", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kieran", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "look at rooms", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t092-041", "text": "Efua had her appraisal yesterday and has been put forward for promotion. Decision by the end of the quarter.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Efua", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "appraisal", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "put forward for promotion", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Decision", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of the quarter", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t092-043", "text": "Alfie is applying for teacher training. He loves working with kids and has volunteered at a youth club for three years.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alfie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "applying for teacher training", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "working with kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "volunteered at a youth club", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t092-045", "text": "Aisha's brother Ayo moves into his first flat on Saturday. She and their mum are driving the van down from Manchester. He's paying for pizza in exchange.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moves into his first flat", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t092-047", "text": "Eli has a phone interview with the charity on Monday and a second one with the publisher the Thursday after. On top of that his lease ends on the 30th, so it's a stressful couple of weeks for him. He said he'd let me know how both go.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "phone interview with the charity", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second one with the publisher", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Thursday after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lease ends", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 30th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressful", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t092-054", "text": "Patrick was turned down for the head of department role. He took it better than I expected. Maybe take him out for a drink next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Patrick", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turned down for the head of department role", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him out for a drink", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t092-057", "text": "Rin's wedding is on 9/14 in Kyoto. She and her fiancée are hoping most people can make it out there. Start looking at flights soon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "9/14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "fiancée", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Start looking at flights", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "soon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t092-058", "text": "Keisha has been really homesick since moving to Toronto in March. Her mum is visiting her over Christmas, which should help. I must call her this weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "homesick", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Toronto", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visiting her", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t092-059", "text": "Anjali says her new manager is great and she's much happier at work now.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anjali", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "happier", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t092-060", "text": "Saw Luis and his wife at the market. They're thinking about moving to Valencia next spring, once the kids finish the school year. He's already learning Spanish on his commute and she's been looking at schools near the old town. No firm date yet, but they're going out in a fortnight to view a few places. I should ask him about it when they're back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luis", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Valencia", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "learning Spanish", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him about it", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "when they're back", "anchor": "a1"}]}
